    <param.summary>Routines for the computation of shock and detonation wave states.</param.summary>
    <param.description>A library (SDToolbox) of MATLAB routines for computations of post-shock conditions and Chapman-Jouguet detonation velocity. Notes and demonstration programs are provided for using this library to compute examples of normal and oblique shocks and detonations,
